                                                "text": "On September 9, when a solitary Japanese patrolman tried to curtail the work of five Taiwanese who were cutting trees from a windbreak (in Anting settlement, Sinhua district), the accused responded \"Taiwan is not Japan's land. Why are you stopping us?\""
